{"rationale":"Key question is RP-1: prod deploy dep-K6FVQ at 12:18:08Z used alias rc with approval apr-6FP84, which covers digest sha256:7a1fba03ee5d1e4d (art-43SFP, scope staging,release, recorded 11:53:48Z). The log never shows what rc resolved to at deploy time. The deploy output says 'alias deploys do not verify digest', and ci-promote promotion reconcile ran at 12:16:12Z, just before the deploy, and may have moved rc. Other builds (art-69FG9, art-JB3C6) exist, and art-69FG9 has only a staging approval. No registry alias resolution record or state API query is present, so the digest actually deployed can't be established.

