{"rationale":"Prod deploy dep-X5PTZ ran at 11:19:10Z with --alias rc, and the alias target is not shown directly. The deploy output says alias deploys do not verify digest, so the cited approval does not settle it. apr-W9YKB covers sha256:ba04cd7d386aace4 (art-TMK8E, scope staging,release), recorded 10:54:44Z. The newest build is art-TMK8E, and the only approval for art-2YF8E is staging-scope, so a rc pointing at art-2YF8E would be a violation. The log has no rc move or promotion record. The ci-promote jobs run throughout, and the staging deploy at 11:57 shows rc moved earlier. The rc target at 11:19 is unresolved.

