{"rationale":"Pool gpu-a100-west quota is 40. Holds from Q1 (complete): res-F5YA5 (17) 10:16:07-11:56:50, res-7229G (15) 10:56:01-12:26:30, res-P795A (20) 12:03:54-12:46:22. Overlap 10:56:01-11:56:50: 17+15=32, under 40. Overlap 12:03:54-12:26:30: 15+20=35, under 40. res-F5YA5 ended 11:56:50 before res-P795A began at 12:03:54, so all three never overlap. res-C95C9 (38) held 09:58:15-10:12:20 ended before res-F5YA5 began at 10:16:07, so 38 alone is under 40. Max concurrent is 35, so no RP-2 violation.

